==Accuracy Modifiers==
Bonuses that increase or decrease accuracy modify the deviation of a shot, or the spread. Bonuses that ''increase'' accuracy ''decrease'' the deviation (spread) of a shot. i.e. a +40% accuracy buff will decrease the spread by -40%. Bonuses that ''decrease'' accuracy ''increase'' the deviation (spread) of a shot. Certain accuracy modifiers that decrease accuracy do so by increasing spread by a flat amount instead of a percentage, despite being labeled as a percentage in-game.
